#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:222
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "Jõudlus"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:224
msgid ""
"If Pipeline performs badly on your device, you may want to change some of "
"those settings. In general, keeping the default settings is recommended. For "
"older devices which do not support GLES 3.0 like the PinePhone, you may want "
"to switch to software rendering. Changing these settings require a restart "
"of Pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Kui Pipeline toimib sinu seadmes aeglaselt, siis siin saad muuta asjaomaseid "
"seadistusi. Üldiselt on hea mõte kasutada vaikimisi seadistusi. Kui kasutad "
"mõnda vanemat seadet, nagu näiteks PinePhone, kus puudub GLES 3.0 tugi, siis "
"võid proovida kasutada tarkvaralist renderdust. Nende seadistuste muutmine "
"eeldab Pipeline'i uuesti käivitamist."

