msgstr "Priit Jõerüüt 2024-2026"

#: src/gui/window.rs:1467
msgid "Failed to set up application"
msgstr "Rakenduse ettevalmistamine ei õnnestunud"

#: src/gui/window.rs:1492
msgid "More Information"
msgstr "Täiendav teave"

#: src/splashes.rs:11
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Pipeline was once called Tubefeeder."
msgstr "Pipeline'i varasem nimi oli Tubefeeder."

#: src/splashes.rs:17
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline was built for mobile linux devices like the PinePhone. That it "
"works on desktops is just a happy side effect."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline oli algselt loodud Linuxipõhistele nutitelefonidele, nagu "
"PinePhone. Et tegemist on ka korraliku töölauarakendusega, oli lihtsalt "
"pisikene kõrvamõju."

#: src/splashes.rs:23
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "The first commit of Pipeline was {} days ago."
msgstr "Esimene sissekanne Pipeline'i lähtekoodi tehti {} päeva tagasi."

#: src/splashes.rs:35
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "You are running commit number {} of Pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Hetkel on sul kasutusel Pipeline'i lähtekoodi sissekandest {} kompileeritud "
"versioon."

#: src/splashes.rs:42
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "You are running release number {} of Pipeline."
msgstr "Hetkel on sul kasutusel Pipeline'i versioon {}."

#: src/splashes.rs:49
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Pipeline is built from {} lines of Rust code."
msgstr "Pipeline on kompileeritud Rustis kirjutatud lähtekoodi {}-st reast."

#: src/splashes.rs:56
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Pipeline is built from {} lines of Blueprint UI markup."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline on kompileeritud Blueprint UI märgendikeele lähtekoodi {}-st reast."

#: src/splashes.rs:64
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "There are {} different splash texts which can be displayed here."
msgstr "Kokku on siin rakenduses {} erinevat vaheteadet."

#. Translators: "Splash" as in the splash text from Minecraft: https://minecraft.wiki/w/Splash.
#: src/splashes.rs:74
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"In expectation, you will need to reload {} times to have seen all splash "
"texts at least once."
msgstr ""
"Olemuslikult peaksid {} korda uuesti laadima, et iga vaheteadet vähemalt ühe "
"korra näha."

#: src/splashes.rs:80
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline is translated in {languages} different languages by {translators} "
"translators"
msgstr "{translators} tõlkijat on tõlkinud Pipeline'i kokku {languages} keelde"

#: src/splashes.rs:94
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can help translate Pipeline using <a href=\"https://hosted.weblate.org/"
"engage/schmiddi-on-mobile/\">Weblate</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sa võid osaleda Pipeline'i tõlkimisel <a href=\"https://hosted.weblate.org/"
"engage/schmiddi-on-mobile/\">Weblate'i veebiteenuses</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:100
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The source code of Pipeline is hosted on <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/"
"schmiddi-on-mobile/pipeline\">GitLab</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline'i lähtekood leidub <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/schmiddi-on-mobile/"
"pipeline\">GitLabis</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:106
#, c-format
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We have a <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix "
"room</a> where you can come and talk with us."
msgstr ""
"Soovid meiega suhelda? Palun liitu <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/"
"%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">meie Matrixi jututoaga</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:112
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline has a <a href=\"https://mobile.schmidhuberj.de/pipeline\">website</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"Vaata ka Pipeline'i <a href=\"https://mobile.schmidhuberj.de/"
"pipeline\">veebisaiti</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:118
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can get Pipeline on <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathub</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline'i saad paigaldada <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathubist</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:124
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/clapper\">Clapper</a> as the "
"video player."
msgstr ""
"Videoesitajana on meil kasutusel <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/"
"clapper\">Clapper</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:130
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">rustypipe</a> "
"and <a href=\"https://piped.video/\">Piped</a> to get data from YouTube."
msgstr ""
"YouTube'ist andmete laadimisel on meil kasutusel <a href=\"https://"
"codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">rustypipe</a> ja <a href=\"https://"
"piped.video/\">Piped</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:136
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The creator of Pipeline has also built other applications, like <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline'i autor on teinud ka sellised head rakendused: <a href=\"https://"
"flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Raudtee (Railway)</a> ja <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:142
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"When using Piped to fetch data, Pipeline will be able to fetch your "
"subscriptions faster with more public Piped instances. So consider <a "
"href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">hosting Piped</a> and "
"making it available for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Kui andmete laadimiseks on kasutusel Piped, siis mida rohkem on Pipedi "
"avalikke servereid, seda kiiremini suudab Pipeline sinu tellimusi sealt "
"laadida. Seega kaalu oma <a href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-"
"hosting/\">Pipedi serveri</a> paigaldamist ja selle avamist kõigile "
"huvilistele."

#: src/splashes.rs:148
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"No animals were harmed while making this application. But two cats were "
"petted."
msgstr ""
"Selle rakenduse tegemisel ei saanud viga ükski loom. Küll aga silitati "
"hoolega kahte kassi."

#: src/splashes.rs:155
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Add videos to your watch-later list by bringing up their context menu, or "
"directly when watching videos."
msgstr ""
"Lisa videoid hilisema vaatamise loendisse kas video kontekstimenüüst või "
"otse vaatamise ajal."

#: src/splashes.rs:161
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Seeing something you don't like? You can hide videos from your feed based on "
"the title and uploader of the video."
msgstr ""
"Näed midagi, mis sulle ei meeldi? Soovi korral saad pealkirja ja üleslaadija "
"alusel videoid oma meediavoost välistada."

#: src/splashes.rs:167
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can hide videos you already watched. Enable this by managing your "
"filters."
msgstr ""
"Võid juba vaadatud videod peita - seda saad seadistada oma filtrite "
"haldamisega."

#: src/splashes.rs:173
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can quickly toggle on and off filters in the feed from the filter dialog."
msgstr "Põhimenüüst saad meediavoo filtreid kergesti sisse-välja lülitada."

#: src/splashes.rs:179
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to keep your subscriptions from YouTube or NewPipe? You can import "
"those into Pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Soovid säilitada oma YouTube'i või NewPipe'i tellimusi? Sa võid neid "
"Pipeline'i importida."

#: src/splashes.rs:185
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to bring your own video player instead of the one built-in? You can "
"manage an external video player in the settings and tell Pipeline to use it "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"Soovid kasutada mõnda muud meediaesitajat, mitte Pipeline'i enda oma? "
"Seadistustest saad hallata välise meediarakenduse tingimusi, sealhulgas tema "
"vaikimisi kasutamist."

#: src/splashes.rs:191
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You want to keep a video you watched? You can directly download it from the "
"video page."
msgstr ""
"Soovid säilitada vaadatud videot? Saad teda otse videovaatest alla laadida."

#: src/splashes.rs:197
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to share a video? You can copy its URL to the clipboard directly from "
"the video page."
msgstr ""
"Soovid videot jagada? Videovaatest saad tema võrguaadressi kopeerida "
"lõikelauale."

#: src/splashes.rs:203
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Are you hosting your own Piped instance? You can tell Pipeline to use it in "
"the settings."
msgstr ""
"Sul on oma Piped'i server? Võid ta Pipeline'i seadistustest võtta kasutusele."

#: src/splashes.rs:210
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Not interested in those splash texts? You can disable them in the settings."
msgstr ""
"Sind ei huvita need infoteated? Lihtsalt lülita nad seadistusest välja."

#: src/splashes.rs:216
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Don't like YouTube anymore? Pipeline also works with <a href=\"https://"
"joinpeertube.org\">PeerTube</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sulle YouTube enam ei meeldi? Pipeline'is toimib ka <a href=\"https://"
"joinpeertube.org\">PeerTube'is</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:222
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Searching for something? Pipeline can help you with that and search for "
"channels and videos on YouTube and Peertube."
msgstr ""
"Otsid midagi? Pipeline oskab leida videoid ja kanaleid nii YouTube'ist, kui "
"Peertube'ist."

#: src/splashes.rs:228
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline has four different ways to fetch videos from YouTube. Just to be "
"sure you don't miss any of your precious cat videos."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline'il on neli erinevat viisi videote laadimiseks YouTube'ist. Seda "
"lihtsalt kindluse mõttes... et sa ikka kõik vajaliku kassivideod kätte "
"saaksid."

#: src/splashes.rs:243
#, c-format
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Have ideas for further splash text? Tell us on <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/"
"%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sul on hea idee täiendava infoteate lisamiseks? Anna meile teada <a "
"href=\"https://matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrixis</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:249
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Pretty sure {year} will be the year of the Linux desktop."
msgstr ""
"On üsna kindel, et {year}. aasta saab lõpuks olema Linuxi läbimurdeaasta "
"töölaual."

#. Translators: A reference to the "I use Arch btw" meme.
#: src/splashes.rs:255
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "I can be used on Arch btw."
msgstr "Muide, see rakendus leidub ka Archis."

#: src/splashes.rs:260
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Do you want to advertise here? You can't."
msgstr "Kas sa tahaksid siin oma reklaame näha? See pole võimalik."

#: src/splashes.rs:277
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "🎉 Pipeline turned {} years old today. Happy Birthday! 🎉"
msgstr "🎉 Pipeline sai täna {} aastaseks. Palju õnne sünnipäevaks! 🎉"

